# Attest continuity + live demo

At session start, read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md`.

Parent brand is **Union Payroll** (https://union-payroll.ltd/), accent `#0074FF`, Manrope — not Media Launch.

## Live demo persistence (critical)

The phone tunnel must stay up across normal coding. **Do not** kill or restart:

- `scripts/keep-tunnel-alive.sh`
- `ssh … nokey@localhost.run`
- tmux session `attest-tunnel`

when editing files, committing, seeding, or rebuilding — unless the user explicitly asks to restart the tunnel, or the SSH process is actually dead.

To publish code to the already-running public demo:

```bash
bash scripts/deploy-live.sh
```

That rebuilds and restarts **only** the API on :8787. The public `*.lhr.life` URL must not change.

Bring-up (once / recovery): `bash scripts/start-live.sh`

When finishing meaningful work, update `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md`, commit, and push (or `/update-project-status`).
